{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想看清自己走過多少週，又剩下多少時間？Weeking 以週為單位把人生畫成一格格視覺化日曆，適合喜歡反思時間、訂立長遠目標的讀者。軟件原價 US $1.99，現正限時免費，於 App Store 下載即可使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-157.webp\">\n<h2>以週為單位規劃人生目標</h2>\n<p>Weeking 把一生化成由方格組成的視覺化週曆，每格代表一週，讓你一眼看清過去、現在與尚未到來的時間。內置長期規劃器可按年齡設定人生里程碑，例如 32 歲置業或 40 歲達成事業目標，並加入提醒。你亦可逐週追蹤年齡、檢視完整時間線，並以不同格式列印週格，程式沒有第三方廣告或追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-282-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-283-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-284-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-285-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-286-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-287-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Weeking: Life In Weeks</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:38.200556+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T22:31:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:58:50.058378+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:13.723951+00:00","content_hash":"f380106376bd57cb6727bc87765761fe95849bffc7c692b74e580434b0ccc5f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}